00:00:57.957 --> 00:00:59.959
extracted entities and correlate those

24
00:01:00.460 --> 00:01:02.962
between the subject graph and the existing domain graph

25
00:01:03.263 --> 00:01:05.965
that was previously created from the CSV files.

26
00:01:06.433 --> 00:01:08.234
That might be a lot to take in right

27
00:01:08.234 --> 00:01:10.236
now. It'll make sense as we go through each step.

28
00:01:10.637 --> 00:01:13.973
As with the other notebooks,
you'll begin by importing the needed libraries.

