00:02:45.431 --> 00:02:47.934
that we need for actually creating a pipeline

63
00:02:47.934 --> 00:02:50.937
that's going to do all the processing of the markdown files,

64
00:02:51.237 --> 00:02:53.940
doing the chunking up
