67
00:02:58.745 --> 00:03:00.480
which you can use to do all the

68
00:03:00.480 --> 00:03:02.248
processing of the chunks
and the entity extraction.

69
00:03:02.448 --> 00:03:04.884
So for all the markdown files you'll be processing,

70
00:03:04.884 --> 00:03:08.021
you'll create some helper functions
to actually get that set up correctly.

71
00:03:08.321 --> 00:03:11.291
But first, let's take a look at the interface
