00:03:17.864 --> 00:03:19.265
but just to show the shape of

76
00:03:19.265 --> 00:03:20.667
actually what it means to actually create

77
00:03:20.667 --> 00:03:22.569
an instance of the SimpleKGPipeline.

78
00:03:23.036 --> 00:03:24.938
It needs to have an LLM, of course,

