00:03:33.112 --> 00:03:35.515
the same LLM or a different one if you want to.

84
00:03:36.216 --> 00:03:40.019
And because we're processing markdown files
instead of PDFs,

85
00:03:40.320 --> 00:03:42.822
this from_pdf is false,

86
00:03:43.122 --> 00:03:44.724
but it's actually kind of true because

