00:12:35.321 --> 00:12:37.656
will be placed into this template format here.

317
00:12:38.157 --> 00:12:40.860
Okay, with all the context that we've set up,

318
00:12:40.960 --> 00:12:44.029
with all the different helper functions
that the knowledge graph builder needs

319
00:12:44.130 --> 00:12:45.931
for doing the pipeline processing.

320
00:12:46.332 --> 00:12:47.800
We're going to go ahead and make

