00:12:47.800 --> 00:12:49.435
the knowledge graph builder and then use it.

322
00:12:49.802 --> 00:12:51.370
So because we're going to create

323
00:12:51.370 --> 00:12:53.205
a knowledge graph builder for every file,

324
00:12:53.506 --> 00:12:56.809
so that we have a specialized prompt based
