00:13:54.700 --> 00:13:56.502
So we're going to use that as the text splitting.

352
00:13:57.002 --> 00:13:59.605
the schema that we assembled as the entity_schema,

353
00:13:59.605 --> 00:14:01.907
and then finally this contextualized_prompt

