00:14:39.945 --> 00:14:41.947
how much responsiveness we get out of OpenAI.

371
00:14:41.947 --> 00:14:44.550
It'll take up to maybe a minute to actually

372
00:14:44.550 --> 00:14:48.254
do all the natural language processing of the document,
doing the extraction,

