00:17:34.286 --> 00:17:36.355
But what we really care about is that

438
00:17:36.355 --> 00:17:38.424
we see the Product, Location, Issue, and Feature.

439
00:17:39.258 --> 00:17:41.193
Now, we do know this because that's

