00:18:02.081 --> 00:18:03.782
that are part of the subject graph.

452
00:18:04.216 --> 00:18:07.019
So let's walk through a couple of elaborations of this query.

453
00:18:07.820 --> 00:18:09.888
The first thing is to take that what you realize

