00:18:24.236 --> 00:18:26.605
We can then return the DISTINCT entity_label.

461
00:18:26.605 --> 00:18:28.607
We should see all the same values, but

462
00:18:28.607 --> 00:18:30.609
now rather than as a bunch of lists,

