00:18:30.609 --> 00:18:32.911
we'll see a single list with all the values.

464
00:18:33.412 --> 00:18:36.615
Okay.
So now the list is really just a couple of rows,

465
00:18:36.815 --> 00:18:38.484
where each row has a single

466
00:18:38.484 --> 00:18:40.419
label, the KG builder, the product, the entity.

467
00:18:40.719 --> 00:18:42.721
You can see it right there.

468
00:18:42.821 --> 00:18:45.023
So let's elaborate a little bit further on this query.

469
00:18:45.424 --> 00:18:48.026
We want to filter out these underscore labels.

