00:19:05.844 --> 00:19:08.447
That should get rid of _KGBuilder_ and _Entity_.

478
00:19:10.249 --> 00:19:12.017
So that's the list that we're looking

479
00:19:12.017 --> 00:19:13.819
for, just Product, Location, Issue, and Feature.

480
00:19:15.354 --> 00:19:17.089
You can then define a utility function

481
00:19:17.089 --> 00:19:18.790
that just wraps that call to Neo4J.

